  "overview": "WFP UI Kit — Humanitarian agency UI kit, Open Sans typography and UN/WFP sky-blue actions",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#ffffff) canvas paired with `#ffffff` component surfaces and `#001f2f` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#007dbc` with `#ffffff` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Open Sans` across 29 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
